  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, the battle butler doubles the critical threat range of weapons he wields or fires (as though he possessed the feat Improved Critical, this does not allow him to qualify for feats with that feat as a prerequisite) while adjacent to, or flanking with, his master and while his service meter is between 10 and 7. If his service meter is between 6 and 4, the critical threat range is increased by 1 (20 becomes 19-20, 19-20 becomes 18-20, 18-20 becomes 17-20), this does not stack with other abilities that increase his critical threat range. If his service meter is lower than 4 he derives no benefit from this class feature.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/battle-butler#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
